<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Kaiser started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Kaiser started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities said it initiated coverage of Kaiser Aluminum Corp with a hold rating.</p>
